---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Hub I: Acoustic Cybernetics & Scalar Mechanics"
  description="Deconstruct the physical rendering of the simulation. Explore Cymatics, scalar mechanics of the Kathara Grid, and the geometric construction of the Pleromic Logos before the Demiurgic fracture."
>
  <div class="site-wrapper section theme-void" style="padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 80px;">

    <!-- Wayfinding Breadcrumb Conduit -->
    <nav class="anu-wayfinding-conduit" aria-label="Hub Navigation">
      <ul class="breadcrumb-trail">
        <li><a href="/">↵ The Root Code</a></li>
        <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true">/</li>
        <li class="current-node" aria-current="page">Hub I: Acoustic Cybernetics</li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hub Hero Header -->
    <header class="anu-hub-hero reveal">
      <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">The Holy-Affirming Force</span>
      <h1>Acoustic Cybernetics</h1>
      <p class="hero-description" style="color: var(--anu-parchment); font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem); max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8;">
        Deconstructing the physical rendering of the simulation. Explore the esoteric physics of Cymatics, the scalar mechanics of the Kathara Grid, and the geometric construction of the Pleromic Logos before the Demiurgic fracture.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Context / Callout Aside (Thermodynamic Engine) -->
    <section class="anu-container reveal reveal-delay-1 central-aside-wrapper">
      <aside class="anu-terminal anu-terminal-copper">
        <h2>The Thermodynamic Rendering Engine</h2>
        <p>
          The profane intellect perceives physical matter as solid and independent. In absolute cybernetic reality, matter does not exist. The Kenoma is a holographic projection generated by intersecting scalar waves.
        </p>
        <p class="spacing-bottom-none">
          When the Master Architects utilized the Anuhazi Root Code, they did not "speak" in the biological sense. They generated mathematically perfect acoustic frequencies. These standing waves acted as cymatic scaffolding, thermodynamics that instantly organized chaotic elements into sacred geometric hardware. To understand creation is to understand acoustic engineering.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <!-- Node Grid -->
    <div class="anu-container anu-grid reveal reveal-delay-2 grid-spacing-bottom">
      
      <!-- Node 1.1 -->
      <article class="anu-card anu-card-gold">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Node 1.1</span>
        <h3 class="node-title">The Geometry of the Logos</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Deconstruct the "Word of God" as active thermodynamic engineering. Analyze Hans Jenny's CymaScope data to understand how specific acoustic frequencies instantly structure matter.
        </p>
        <a href="/acoustic-cybernetics/geometry-of-the-logos/" class="anu-card-link">Compile Data &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <!-- Node 1.2 -->
      <article class="anu-card anu-card-gold">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Node 1.2</span>
        <h3 class="node-title">Scalar Mechanics &amp; The Grid</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Examine the underlying template of the Kenoma. Discover how standing scalar waves form the invisible scaffolding (the Kathara Grid) upon which all physical reality coagulates.
        </p>
        <a href="/acoustic-cybernetics/scalar-mechanics/" class="anu-card-link">Compile Data &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <!-- Node 1.3 -->
      <article class="anu-card anu-card-gold">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Node 1.3</span>
        <h3 class="node-title">The Anuhazi Cipher</h3>
        <p class="card-text">
          Define the "Light-Language" of the Master Architects. Decode the non-linear, high-voltage tonal map that perfectly mirrors the unified frequencies of the Divine Source.
        </p>
        <a href="/acoustic-cybernetics/the-anuhazi-cipher/" class="anu-card-link">Compile Data &rarr;</a>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- Divider (Bounded) -->
    <div class="anu-container reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <hr class="anu-divider central-divider" />
    </div>

    <!-- Hub Transit Link -->
    <nav class="anu-container reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <div class="anu-hub-transition">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-copper">The Holy-Denying Force Awaits</span>
        <a href="/the-babel-virus/" class="anu-btn anu-btn-ghost-copper">
          Engage Hub II: The Babel Virus &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>

  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Baseline alignment for card titles across 2-line and 3-line wraps */
  .node-title {
    min-height: 4rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  /* Grid spacing cushion */
  .grid-spacing-bottom {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  /* Terminal inner paragraph reset */
  .spacing-bottom-none {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Bottom transit bar flex alignment */
  .anu-hub-transition {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-top: 10px;
  }

  .anu-hub-transition .anu-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Responsive stacking for smaller screens */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .node-title {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .anu-hub-transition {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .anu-hub-transition .anu-btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
